.TH LSA-GUI 1 "October 2026" "lsa-sysinfo 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lsa-gui \- Linux System Audit cache and memory benchmark (GTK 3)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lsa-gui
.br
.B lsa-gui \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
The graphical Cache & Memory Benchmark of Linux System Audit, a clean-room
Linux implementation of AIDA64 Business features (AIDA64 is by FinalWire Ltd.;
not affiliated). It shows read, write, copy and latency results for memory and
the L1, L2 and L3 caches together with CPU and memory details.
.PP
The
.B Guide
button opens the user guide; F1 opens the section of the value under the
mouse pointer, and right-clicking a value offers
.BR "Open guide" .
.PP
With command-line arguments,
.B lsa-gui
behaves like
.BR lsa (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lsa (1)
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/eugenesflanagin-spec/lsa-sysinfo
